<div class="slide">
  <div class="slide__text">
    <p class="slide__headline">Intentional production.</p>
    <p class="slide__headline">Immersive spaces.</p>
    <p class="slide__headline">Collective energy.</p>
    <p>Every element, down to each carefully hung jellyfish, reflects months of thoughtful, hands on planning. Since 2023, we’ve produced playful activations that <strong>inspire movement &amp; meaningful connection</strong>.</p>
    <p>But our real story began over a decade ago, when many of us met for the first time attending meetups at shows &amp; festivals in search of community.</p>
    <p>Driven by the power of collective transformative experiences, and a shared love for elevated production, we curate <strong>sound, light, and environment</strong> to honor the dancefloors that brought us together.</p>
  </div>
