<div class="slide slide--flip">
  <div class="slide__text">
    <p class="eyebrow">The collective</p>
    <h2 class="slide__heading">Built by the people in the room.</h2>
    <ul class="slide__list">
      <li>Leadership is temporary by design. Whoever steps up as Camp Lead runs that activation, and only that one.</li>
      <li>Show up with ideas or energy and you're already a jelly. Every voice carries equal weight while a build is live.</li>
      <li>Dues are split evenly and fund the build, nothing else.</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/how-it-works/" class="cta-btn">See how we work →</a>
  </div>
